install c# dev kit: from extensions tab

Install dotnet10 : https://dotnet.microsoft.com/en-us/download/dotnet/10.0
Check version: dotnet --version

install xunit.v3: dotnet new install xunit.v3.templates
check version: 

create xunit.v3 playwright project: dotnet new xunit -n MyPlaywrightTests
navigate to unit test project: cd MyPlaywrightTests

playwright core package: dotnet add package Microsoft.Playwright

playwright xunit integration:  dotnet add package Microsoft.Playwright.Xunit

Build Project: dotnet build

Install Browsers: pwsh bin/Debug/net10.0/playwright.ps1 install
Install Browsers: powershell bin/Debug/net10.0/playwright.ps1 install (use this if pwsh not found)

run xunit test: dotnet test

install reqnroll: add reqnroll extension

Add .gitignore file: dotnet new gitignore

Install reqnroll related packages:
    ->  dotnet add package Reqnroll
    ->  dotnet add package Reqnroll.xUnit
    ->  dotnet add package Microsoft.Playwright
    ->  dotnet add package Microsoft.Playwright.Xunit






